  "allocation_interpretation": "dhat tracks Rust heap payload allocation/reallocation traffic, peak and retained payload. Allocator overhead/fragmentation and prepared source/tools are excluded; source/output validation scratch and operation history are included. native_only drops reports; released drops result Body.",
